/// Code sets the rope up and changes it through W3DRopeDraw::initRopeParms,
/// W3DRopeDraw::setRopeCurLen and W3DRopeDraw::setRopeSpeed. Zero Hour:
/// those calls come through \c RopeDrawInterface, which the module
/// implements, and the Chinook's rappelling uses the ropes.
///
/// \par Modding
/// Its data comes from the shared field-less factory
