///
/// \param thing       The drawable being built.
/// \param moduleData  The template's field-less module data.
/// \return The new module, as a Module pointer.
/// \see W3DDebrisDraw::friend_newModuleData


/// \class W3DSupplyDraw
/// \ingroup grp_w1021_w3d_draw_module_factories
/// \brief Draw module registered as "W3DSupplyDraw": a model draw module
///        configured by a supply bone prefix (Zero Hour: shows how much
///        supply is left by hiding bones).
///
/// BFME 2's constructor runs the W3DScriptedModelDraw constructor (Zero
/// Hour derives the class from W3DModelDraw) and initialises two values of
/// its own. Its data's \c buildFieldParse adds W3DModelDrawModuleData's
/// table before its own. Zero Hour: when the supply status reported to
/// draw modules changes, the module counts the model's bones named with
/// the prefix followed by a two-digit number and shows the same share of
/// them as the share of supply left, hiding the rest.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields of the module data, after the model draw fields:
/// \c SupplyBonePrefix (text).
/// \see W3DSupplyDraw::friend_newModuleInstance,
