///
/// Same pattern as W3DBuffDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData. The field
/// source, W3DSupplyDrawModuleData::buildFieldParse, adds the model draw
/// table and then \c SupplyBonePrefix.
///
/// \param ini  The reader positioned on the module's block, or null.
/// \return The new module data, as a ModuleData pointer.
/// \see W3DSupplyDraw::friend_newModuleInstance


