/// \class W3DTreeDraw
/// \ingroup grp_w1021_w3d_draw_module_factories
/// \brief Draw module registered as "W3DTreeDraw", configured by model,
///        texture, topple, sink, morph, taint and fade fields (Zero Hour:
///        the terrain's tree buffer draws the tree).
///
/// BFME 2's constructor only runs the DrawModule constructor, and the
/// instance factory allocates no more than a DrawModule needs, so the
/// module keeps no per-drawable state of its own. Zero Hour: the module
/// hands the tree to the terrain render object's tree buffer
/// (BaseHeightMapRenderObjClass::addTree) the first time its transform is
/// set, with the model, texture and topple settings, and the buffer draws
/// and topples all trees. BFME 2 has the same tree buffer
/// (W3DTreeBuffer::addTree); which BFME 2 code hands trees to it is not
/// established here.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields of W3DTreeDrawModuleData: \c ModelName, \c TextureName,
/// \c StumpName and \c MorphTree (text); \c MoveOutwardTime,
/// \c MoveInwardTime, \c SinkTime and \c MorphTime (durations);
/// \c MoveOutwardDistanceFactor, \c DarkeningFactor and \c FadeDistance
/// (reals); \c MinimumToppleSpeed and \c SinkDistance (positive reals);
/// \c InitialVelocityPercent, \c InitialAccelPercent and
/// \c BounceVelocityPercent (percentages); \c ToppleFX, \c BounceFX and
/// \c MorphFX (FX lists); \c KillWhenFinishedToppling, \c DoTopple and
/// \c TaintedTree (yes/no); \c FadeRate and \c FadeTarget (whole numbers).
/// The morph, taint and fade fields are not in Zero Hour's table, and
/// Zero Hour's \c DoShadow is not in BFME 2's. Zero Hour groups the
/// \c MoveOutward and \c MoveInward fields and \c DarkeningFactor as
/// push-aside settings, and the velocity, accel, bounce, speed and sink
/// fields as topple settings.
/// Durations are written in milliseconds and stored as logic frames when
/// the INI is read (INI::parseDurationUnsignedInt).
/// \see W3DTreeDraw::friend_newModuleInstance,
///      W3DTreeDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \class W3DTreeDrawModuleData
/// \ingroup grp_w1021_w3d_draw_module_factories
/// \brief Module data for W3DTreeDraw: model, texture and the topple, sink,
///        morph and fade settings.
///
/// Built by W3DTreeDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData; the field list is
/// on W3DTreeDraw.

/// \fn Module *W3DTreeDraw::friend_newModuleInstance(Thing *thing, const ModuleData *moduleData)
/// \brief Instance factory registered for "W3DTreeDraw": creates the module
///        for one drawable.
///
/// Same pattern as W3DBuffDraw::friend_newModuleInstance.
///
/// \param thing       The drawable being built.
/// \param moduleData  The template's shared W3DTreeDrawModuleData.
/// \return The new module, as a Module pointer.
/// \see W3DTreeDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \fn ModuleData *W3DTreeDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "W3DTreeDraw": creates the module data
///        and parses the INI block into it.
///
/// Same pattern as W3DBuffDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData, with
/// W3DTreeDrawModuleData::buildFieldParse, a single table, as the field
/// source.
///
/// \param ini  The reader positioned on the module's block, or null.
/// \return The new module data, as a ModuleData pointer.
/// \see W3DTreeDraw::friend_newModuleInstance
